3854
04:26:25,220 --> 04:26:28,340
And there's actually a functional reason for the music to be there during those parts.

3855
04:26:28,340 --> 04:26:31,820
It's because I used to always forget to switch the overlay.

3856
04:26:32,420 --> 04:26:35,340
So I would keep playing with the map up and people would be going...

3857
04:26:36,100 --> 04:26:37,260
Remove the map!

3858
04:26:37,820 --> 04:26:41,480
