3863
04:26:49,880 --> 04:26:52,220
When they need to do the kick and get out.

3864
04:26:56,840 --> 04:26:58,060
I'm curious about your setup.

3865
04:26:58,240 --> 04:27:00,800
How do you have chat minimized or visible without being able to read?

3866
04:27:01,340 --> 04:27:03,460
So the way I have it set up is I have two monitors.

3867
04:27:04,080 --> 04:27:10,540
I have the main monitor and then I have a monitor on the side, which is like 90 degrees rotated.

3868
04:27:11,500 --> 04:27:12,860
And then I have my OBS there.

3869
04:27:13,800 --> 04:27:18,220
And OBS has a little preview of what the stream has.

3870
04:27:18,680 --> 04:27:20,760
And on that is the chat, but it's super small.

3871
04:27:22,800 --> 04:27:23,520
You know?

3872
04:27:23,900 --> 04:27:27,560
So if I look over, if I really focus, I can read it.

3873
04:27:28,840 --> 04:27:32,660
But if I look over at a glance, I can quickly see if, for example, people are spamming emotes.

3874
04:27:33,220 --> 04:27:34,360
That's pretty much what it is.

3875
04:27:35,380 --> 04:27:39,020
But now, while I'm talking to you, I have the full screen on my main monitor.

3876
04:27:40,140 --> 04:27:41,620
So I can properly see the chat.

3877
04:27:42,140 --> 04:27:43,540
Also so I can look all the way up.

3878
04:27:45,620 --> 04:27:46,500
So that's the setup.

3879
04:27:51,510 --> 04:27:52,490
Did you resize it yourself?

3880
04:27:52,490 --> 04:27:57,430
No, it's just so the preview of the game is a small window in itself, you know?

3881
04:27:57,890 --> 04:28:01,910
And remember, the chat is like a small part of that preview.

3882
04:28:03,130 --> 04:28:04,010
If that makes sense.

3883
04:28:08,630 --> 04:28:11,650
So it's not actually the chat being on that screen.

3884
04:28:11,710 --> 04:28:13,690
It's just the preview containing the chat.

3885
04:28:14,570 --> 04:28:18,690
It's basically the stream, but in a smaller form.

3886
04:28:20,970 --> 04:28:21,450
Yeah.

3887
04:28:23,330 --> 04:28:29,270
Oh, and the reason I have it rotated 90 degrees is simply because there's not enough room on my desk to have both monitors at...

3888
04:28:29,270 --> 04:28:31,250
I need to have it more wide desk for that.

3889
04:28:34,030 --> 04:28:35,750
The rain sounds reminds me of Rainworld.

3890
04:28:36,810 --> 04:28:37,010
I know.

3891
04:28:37,650 --> 04:28:37,870
Same.

3892
04:28:39,190 --> 04:28:40,430
I think rain is so relaxing.

3893
04:28:41,130 --> 04:28:42,050
